<p>
He was right off the boat from Ireland in ~1880.  Their son Thomas was born in
England while they were waiting for the boat to the US.  John was apparently
the hell raiser of the bunch.  He was in the cement or plaster union,
and was always on top of crates yelling about crooked management and got
thrown in jail and beat up by the cops every couple of weeks.
He was the Secretary Treasurer of a local New York City Plaster Union. 
He made the cast of The Last Supper that hangs in Grandmom's
(Mrs. Edna Sheridan) dinning area.

